/**
 * The Cosmic Corner: sun-sign math, deterministic for-fun daily horoscopes,
 * and playful natal-chart placements. No external API, no ephemeris —
 * everything here is generated by the app, for fun, in the Off*Script voice.
 *
 * Freshness design: each pool is walked in a per-sign seeded permutation, so
 * the same sign never repeats a reading within the pool's length (24 days for
 * the main pools) and different signs get different readings on the same day.
 */

